AA40644"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 2026-07-21 173420.png", "id": "1650908107040372", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312236_1650908110373705_16848492286453936_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z5kR2ztM4nIQ7kNvwHjJzMr&_nc_oc=Adq-jjYWrPhkAXy7T9EOGQVRHjRshA-MWqcy5e0VIOn024FAXKZV8ywzZrrhp97JeJU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL6-R0PwlfiRCUm6Uy0usqpZZklg9GvE0brXOSXRcP1nw&oe=6AA3F17B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cardiac Arrest", "keywords": ["Cardiac", "Arrest", "Medvr"], "long_description": "Cardiac Arrest is an interactive virtual reality training simulation designed to help learners develop the knowledge and confidence needed to respond effectively during a cardiac arrest emergency.\nStep into realistic emergency scenarios where you will assess the patient, recognize the signs of cardiac arrest, activate the emergency response process, perform high-quality CPR, and correctly use an Automated External Defibrillator (AED). The simulation provides a safe, immersive environment to practice critical life-saving procedures without real-world risk.\nDesigned for healthcare students, medical professionals, first responders, and anyone seeking hands-on emergency response training, Cardiac Arrest reinforces essential skills through engaging VR-based learning. Improve decision-making, procedural accuracy, and readiness while experiencing realistic interactions that prepare you to act confidently when every second counts.", "short_description": "Cardiac Arrest is an immersive VR medical simulation that trains users to recognize and respond to cardiac arrest emergencies. Practice rapid assessment, high-quality CPR, AED operation, and critical decision-making in realistic scenarios designed to build confidence, improve emergency response skills, and reinforce life-saving protocols."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://w